<title>NEW ZEALAND: BIL supports court review of Winebox panel.</title>
<headline>BIL supports court review of Winebox panel.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brierley Investment Ltd said on Wednesday it had serious concerns about four interviews conducted by the Commission of Inquiry into the &quot;winebox&quot; affair in April 1995 and would support a High Court review of aspects of Commission's conduct.</p>
</text>
